# Documentation & Git

- All project knowledge lives in `docs/`
- Task files live in `tasks/{planned,in-progress,done,blocked}/`
- Update status docs after every work session
- Commit messages: `type(scope): description`
- Types: feat, fix, docs, refactor, test, chore
- Branch from master for features
- Never force-push to master
